{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memento Dawn is a colorful puzzle game in which we can control the light and shadow to help the girl find a way to get back her memories. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PUZZLE GAME FOR WHOLESOME EXPERIENCE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the girl's journey through a beautiful land where her memories are kept and help her answer the hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/60b75e2a82eab7e6b8f8730276da1b5e.avif?t=1771925592\" width=610 height=267 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE BUT SIMPLE MECHANIC FOR EVERYONE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate light and shadow to create a path for the girl to go through the darkness. Collect memories to unfold a lovely story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.poster.avif?t=1771925592\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.webm?t=1771925592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/cc08df97ddec07fe4b9909f478fc80a1.mp4?t=1771925592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/08f434c31c6072897189d3c369534424.poster.avif?t=1771925592\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319360/extras/08